1
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:09,620
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,995 --> 00:00:12,145
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,829
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,395 --> 00:00:22,376
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:28,274
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,274 --> 00:00:30,514
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:35,410
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,095 --> 00:00:39,743
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:44,146
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,845 --> 00:00:49,320
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:52,968
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,770 --> 00:00:58,277
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,277 --> 00:01:01,925
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,404 --> 00:01:09,361
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,193 --> 00:01:15,713
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,713 --> 00:01:18,387
=Episode 18=

17
00:01:25,990 --> 00:01:26,589
Boss.

18
00:01:27,830 --> 00:01:29,190
What about the entertainment complex?

19
00:01:29,669 --> 00:01:30,470
Are we really in the clear?

20
00:01:32,350 --> 00:01:34,149
What if Shen Yanlin sent men to snoop?

21
00:01:34,470 --> 00:01:35,869
So what if he did?

22
00:01:36,630 --> 00:01:38,190
The election is in two days.

23
00:01:38,589 --> 00:01:39,910
They'll only scratch the surface.

24
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:42,470
It won't amount to much.

25
00:01:43,389 --> 00:01:44,110
But...

26
00:01:44,550 --> 00:01:45,830
there are gang rules.

27
00:01:46,869 --> 00:01:48,509
If they really find something,

28
00:01:48,509 --> 00:01:49,270
we...

29
00:01:51,550 --> 00:01:52,110
Bao Zun.

30
00:01:54,309 --> 00:01:56,110
Get one thing straight.

31
00:01:57,229 --> 00:01:58,149
We were never the ones

32
00:01:58,910 --> 00:02:01,029
dealing drugs.

33
00:02:02,110 --> 00:02:02,669
Right.

34
00:02:03,589 --> 00:02:04,949
I know what to do.

35
00:02:05,221 --> 00:02:08,159
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)

36
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:23,000
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant Menu)

37
00:02:53,755 --> 00:02:54,324
Waiter.

38
00:02:55,271 --> 00:02:55,911
A Coke, please.

39
00:02:56,470 --> 00:02:56,870
Sure.

40
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:06,280
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant Menu)

41
00:03:09,646 --> 00:03:11,982
(Menu)

42
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:22,300
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant Menu)

43
00:03:24,709 --> 00:03:25,736
Keep watch here.

44
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:31,720
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)

45
00:03:37,274 --> 00:03:40,746
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)

46
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:03,389
(I just don't get)

47
00:04:03,389 --> 00:04:05,030
(why you always insist on coming here.)

48
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:07,008
(12 slices, 20 skewers)

49
00:04:09,556 --> 00:04:11,520
(8 slices, 20 skewers)

50
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:13,880
(8:20)

51
00:04:22,194 --> 00:04:23,681
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)

52
00:04:26,349 --> 00:04:26,909
Dazui.

53
00:04:30,190 --> 00:04:31,589
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant Menu)
What's this character?

54
00:04:33,070 --> 00:04:34,389
R-Rong...

55
00:04:34,949 --> 00:04:35,389
Rongxing?

56
00:04:37,029 --> 00:04:37,870
Where did it happen?

57
00:04:38,630 --> 00:04:41,110
On Tika Road, near Rongxing Building.

58
00:04:42,547 --> 00:04:43,907
Right. Rongxing.

59
00:04:45,777 --> 00:04:48,857
(Sold Out, Rongxing, Braised Goose)

60
00:04:48,857 --> 00:04:49,537
Boss Lin.

61
00:04:55,402 --> 00:04:56,202
Did you confirm everything?

62
00:04:56,410 --> 00:04:56,971
Don't worry, Boss Lin.

63
00:04:57,413 --> 00:04:58,614
I hired the best hacker around.

64
00:04:58,959 --> 00:05:00,279
Hacking the system won't be a problem.

65
00:05:03,949 --> 00:05:04,790
Did you get him out?

66
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,110
I watched him leave the country.

67
00:05:08,990 --> 00:05:09,750
Remember,

68
00:05:10,025 --> 00:05:10,905
no one can know about this.

69
00:05:12,469 --> 00:05:12,870
Understood.

70
00:05:48,658 --> 00:05:55,658
(Shicheng Royal Police Intake Form
Lin Che)

71
00:06:01,709 --> 00:06:04,149
The way you broke all that down,

72
00:06:04,750 --> 00:06:06,110
you sounded just like a cop.

73
00:06:06,589 --> 00:06:06,990
That's right.

74
00:06:08,389 --> 00:06:09,550
I am a cop.

75
00:06:10,750 --> 00:06:12,670
The people who know every detail
of our shipments

76
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:14,949
include me.

77
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:18,110
What if I really were your enemy?

78
00:06:26,728 --> 00:06:28,744
(Shicheng Royal Police Intake Form
Lin Che)

79
00:07:01,301 --> 00:07:02,990
(To all our listeners,)

80
00:07:03,230 --> 00:07:05,990
(it's December 31, 1999.)

81
00:07:05,990 --> 00:07:07,949
(It's 11:59 p.m.)

82
00:07:08,494 --> 00:07:09,494
(In 60 seconds,)

83
00:07:09,705 --> 00:07:11,424
(we'll bid farewell to this century)

84
00:07:12,029 --> 00:07:13,829
(and welcome the new millennium.)

85
00:07:14,907 --> 00:07:17,787
(All of Shicheng is waiting,)

86
00:07:18,537 --> 00:07:19,977
(waiting for the bells to ring,)

87
00:07:20,384 --> 00:07:22,585
(waiting for a brand-new beginning.)

88
00:07:24,650 --> 00:07:27,103
(May no one's wait be in vain.)

89
00:07:27,744 --> 00:07:30,304
(May every dream take root.)

90
00:07:31,483 --> 00:07:35,067
♪Raise it, lower it, choke on the pain♪

91
00:07:37,182 --> 00:07:40,430
♪Your path lies beyond the night♪
(December 1999)

92
00:07:41,419 --> 00:07:44,730
♪I knew your outline at a glance♪

93
00:07:46,249 --> 00:07:49,370
♪Now it's blurred by mist♪

94
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:54,500
Fu.

95
00:07:56,509 --> 00:07:57,349
Happy New Year.

96
00:07:59,025 --> 00:08:02,945
♪Fireworks light up your profile♪

97
00:08:03,855 --> 00:08:06,655
♪And light up my night as well♪

98
00:08:07,944 --> 00:08:12,088
♪We look up at the very same time♪

99
00:08:12,309 --> 00:08:15,557
♪Yet stand beneath different roofs♪

100
00:08:16,588 --> 00:08:20,732
♪Fireworks spiral into the sky♪

101
00:08:21,906 --> 00:08:24,930
♪They blaze, then fade into smoke♪

102
00:08:26,610 --> 00:08:30,754
♪Silence on the line feels endless♪

103
00:08:30,995 --> 00:08:37,267
♪Can we still be who we were♪

104
00:08:40,317 --> 00:08:44,229
♪Who still asks what's true anymore♪

105
00:08:44,229 --> 00:08:44,910
Hey, Boss Che.

106
00:08:45,420 --> 00:08:46,100
Lin.

107
00:08:49,481 --> 00:08:50,469
Happy New Year.

108
00:08:53,709 --> 00:08:54,629
Happy New Year.

109
00:08:58,177 --> 00:08:59,000
Boss Che.

110
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:02,430
Tomorrow is Fu's seventh-day memorial.

111
00:09:03,961 --> 00:09:05,500
I want to take a walk by the sea.

112
00:09:07,203 --> 00:09:10,451
♪And light up my night as well♪

113
00:09:11,588 --> 00:09:15,956
♪We look up at the very same time♪

114
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:20,051
♪Yet stand beneath different roofs♪

115
00:09:20,051 --> 00:09:24,307
♪Fireworks spiral into the sky♪

116
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:28,035
Fu.

117
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,159
You were right.

118
00:09:30,865 --> 00:09:34,546
(Che is a good man.)

119
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:37,150
Che...

120
00:09:39,700 --> 00:09:40,800
is a good man.

121
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:45,910
Fu.

122
00:09:47,989 --> 00:09:48,834
Happy New Year.

123
00:10:53,364 --> 00:10:54,685
And I want to protect you
and my brother.

124
00:10:55,342 --> 00:10:55,943
Lin.

125
00:10:59,325 --> 00:11:00,565
I'll protect you both too.

126
00:11:33,749 --> 00:11:35,829
My brother loved coming to the beach.

127
00:11:38,829 --> 00:11:39,989
Time flies.

128
00:11:41,190 --> 00:11:42,469
He's been gone seven days already.

129
00:11:45,709 --> 00:11:46,469
Yeah.

130
00:11:49,109 --> 00:11:50,390
I used to think only about

131
00:11:51,186 --> 00:11:52,466
how I could climb higher.

132
00:11:54,844 --> 00:11:55,925
But in the end,

133
00:11:57,484 --> 00:11:58,285
Boss Hui died,

134
00:11:59,967 --> 00:12:00,646
and my brother too.

135
00:12:02,362 --> 00:12:03,601
I couldn't protect anyone.

136
00:12:06,106 --> 00:12:07,665
I don't even know

137
00:12:08,430 --> 00:12:09,229
what any of this is for anymore.

138
00:12:13,484 --> 00:12:15,565
Dongshan Tai
drove Boss Hui to his death.

139
00:12:16,508 --> 00:12:17,307
I have to

140
00:12:18,388 --> 00:12:19,468
avenge him.

141
00:12:23,187 --> 00:12:24,148
What are you going to do?

142
00:12:26,748 --> 00:12:27,508
Kill them.

143
00:12:34,228 --> 00:12:35,628
Killing him would be too easy.

144
00:12:37,427 --> 00:12:38,468
After everything that's happened,

145
00:12:38,468 --> 00:12:39,187
I've realized

146
00:12:40,468 --> 00:12:41,508
letting him live

147
00:12:42,468 --> 00:12:43,547
would be far crueler.

148
00:12:51,468 --> 00:12:52,587
So you want to

149
00:12:54,187 --> 00:12:56,148
prove Dongshan Tai is dealing drugs.

150
00:12:57,228 --> 00:12:58,907
I won't let him

151
00:12:58,907 --> 00:13:00,268
become the shot-caller.

152
00:13:02,268 --> 00:13:03,628
I'll make his life a living hell.

153
00:13:07,108 --> 00:13:07,868
Then what?

154
00:13:09,268 --> 00:13:10,067
Then...

155
00:13:12,787 --> 00:13:13,827
we leave Shicheng

156
00:13:14,388 --> 00:13:15,108
and start over.

157
00:13:19,307 --> 00:13:20,148
Will you help me?

158
00:13:50,547 --> 00:13:51,427
Is the intel reliable?

159
00:13:51,707 --> 00:13:52,187
It's solid.

160
00:13:52,707 --> 00:13:54,348
Soon after Fei Liu's boat docked,

161
00:13:54,628 --> 00:13:55,947
the distributors had new stock.

162
00:13:56,388 --> 00:13:57,587
Tidao and Dazui checked.

163
00:13:57,988 --> 00:13:59,228
The day trouble hit the complex,

164
00:13:59,628 --> 00:14:00,947
Fei Liu had a boat moving too.

165
00:14:01,868 --> 00:14:03,427
To tie him directly to drug trafficking,

166
00:14:04,307 --> 00:14:05,187
Fei Liu's side is locked down tight.

167
00:14:05,628 --> 00:14:06,547
It won't be easy.

168
00:14:12,988 --> 00:14:14,868
Finding proof they're trafficking drugs

169
00:14:15,307 --> 00:14:16,268
isn't our job.

170
00:14:17,827 --> 00:14:18,827
It's the police's.

171
00:14:59,947 --> 00:15:00,547
Okay.

172
00:15:00,988 --> 00:15:01,947
Guys, wrap it up.

173
00:15:14,748 --> 00:15:16,028
Any word on Bao Zun?

174
00:15:17,028 --> 00:15:18,187
We've searched everywhere we can.

175
00:15:18,587 --> 00:15:19,468
No sign of him.

176
00:15:20,268 --> 00:15:21,187
What about the cops?

177
00:15:21,787 --> 00:15:22,827
The cops

178
00:15:23,187 --> 00:15:24,907
haven't made any moves lately.

179
00:15:25,748 --> 00:15:26,787
Bao Zun isn't at the station.

180
00:15:27,587 --> 00:15:28,508
But Boss Tai,

181
00:15:29,307 --> 00:15:30,868
Bao Zun disappearing...

182
00:15:31,508 --> 00:15:32,707
doesn't that seem suspicious?

183
00:15:33,748 --> 00:15:34,547
It doesn't matter.

184
00:15:37,787 --> 00:15:38,868
Keep it quiet for now.

185
00:15:39,388 --> 00:15:40,427
We'll deal with it after the election.

186
00:15:41,388 --> 00:15:41,868
Yes.

187
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:50,587
(Dongcheng Tiger)

188
00:15:50,587 --> 00:15:51,827
Any word from Tidao?

189
00:15:52,787 --> 00:15:53,748
We've been looking for days.

190
00:15:53,748 --> 00:15:54,707
Nothing. Not even a peep.

191
00:15:55,148 --> 00:15:56,187
At a time like this,

192
00:15:57,307 --> 00:15:58,427
you need to stay calm.

193
00:15:59,228 --> 00:16:00,587
The election is almost here.

194
00:16:01,427 --> 00:16:02,268
How am I supposed to stay calm?

195
00:16:13,901 --> 00:16:14,381
Here.

196
00:16:33,587 --> 00:16:35,348
We can't get into the core operation.

197
00:16:36,348 --> 00:16:38,028
And the distributor lead went cold.

198
00:16:38,907 --> 00:16:40,107
Every time Fei Liu moves drugs,

199
00:16:40,108 --> 00:16:41,508
he takes a huge risk.

200
00:16:43,427 --> 00:16:44,988
He can't be moving only small amounts.

201
00:16:47,691 --> 00:16:49,811
So Fei Liu must stockpile the drugs

202
00:16:51,307 --> 00:16:52,307
and move them out little by little.

203
00:16:52,907 --> 00:16:54,508
Fei Liu must have a warehouse.

204
00:16:56,986 --> 00:16:57,505
Fine.

205
00:17:01,468 --> 00:17:01,988
I'll go.

206
00:17:03,307 --> 00:17:03,787
Boss Che.

207
00:17:07,307 --> 00:17:08,347
I'll send Tidao.
